cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Chinese-SkillSpan or Chinese JobBERT, please cite this work.
title: "Chinese-SkillSpan: A Benchmark for Competency Span Extraction from Chinese Job Advertisements"
version: 0.1.3
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Chinese-SkillSpan provides competency-span annotations for Chinese job
  advertisements, annotation guidelines, and evaluation tools. The original
  corpus contains 22,840 sentences from four recruitment collections. Version
  v0.1.3 includes a 150-sentence human reference and released Silver-plus B2
  training and development files. The flat, ESCO-informed label inventory
  distinguishes language, knowledge, occupational skills, and transversal
  competences. Historical evaluation protocols and later expanded-Silver
  experiments are documented separately in the project repository.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22698504
url: https://github.com/AlfredJamesLi/chinese-skillspan-benchmark
